lue for 'L')","marks":1}]},"maps":{"pdf-source":"data/pdf/j277/yearpapers/J27701_Computer_Systems_June_2023 (2).pdf","question-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-1-2023-june/question/page-006.png"]],"markscheme-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-1-2023-june/markscheme/page-021.png"]],"dev-qa":"e2e/screenshots/yearpapers/paper-1-2023-june/dev-qa/q-3-a.png"}},{"question_id":"3(b)(i)","parent_question":3,"topic":"image metadata","marks":1,"command_word":"state","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Binary numbers can also represent images."},{"type":"text","value":"The table shows the colours that are used in an image and the binary value for each colour."},{"type":"table","headers":["Colour","Binary value"],"rows":[["Red","0000"],["Green","0010"],["Blue","1000"],["Purple","0110"]]},{"type":"text","value":"The metadata states that the image is 3 pixels wide by 4 pixels high."},{"type":"text","value":"The data in the file starts in the top left of the image and goes from left-to-right, top-to-bottom."},{"type":"text","value":"State what is meant by metadata in an image file."}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"1 mark for: data about the data / image / file."},{"type":"list","items":["Do not award 'identifies the colour of each pixel'."]},{"type":"text","value":"The question asks for a definition, not an example. Vague phrasings such as 'details about the image' or 'information about the image' are not enough on their own, but read any supporting example for benefit of the doubt (e.g. 'Information about the image, such as the number of pixels' - BOD). Data may be described as properties or characteristics."}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"Metadata defined as data (or properties/characteristics) about the image/file/data","marks":1}]},"maps":{"pdf-source":"data/pdf/j277/yearpapers/J27701_Computer_Systems_June_2023 (2).pdf","question-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-1-2023-june/question/page-006.png"]],"markscheme-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/