ow / understand the code / easier to debug — example: a suitable comment for this algorithm","**Use of subroutines** — reuse blocks of code / make code easier to follow — example: a subroutine for this algorithm","**Use of constants** — store data that will not change during program execution / so data can be changed in one place only — example: store 512 as a constant"]},{"type":"text","value":"Benefit of doubt for notes / whitespace / blank lines as alternatives to comments."},{"type":"text","value":"Do not allow:"},{"type":"list","items":["Indentation (already done in the program given)","\\"Makes it easier to understand\\" by itself (too vague)","Expansions where it isn\'t clear which method is being discussed"]}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"First maintainability method identified (e.g. meaningful identifiers, comments, subroutines, constants)","marks":1},{"criteria":"Expansion / example of the first method applied to this algorithm","marks":1},{"criteria":"Second maintainability method identified","marks":1},{"criteria":"Expansion / example of the second method applied to this algorithm","marks":1}]},"maps":{"pdf-source":"data/pdf/j277/yearpapers/J27702_Computational_thinking_algorithms_and_programming_June_2024 (3).pdf","question-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-2-2024-june/question/page-008.png"]],"markscheme-png":[["data/png/j277/yearpapers/paper-2-2024-june/markscheme/page-025.png"]],"dev-qa":"e2e/screenshots/yearpapers/paper-2-2024-june/dev-qa/q-8-a.png"},"subtopic":{"code":"2.3.1","title":"Defensive design"},"unit":"2.3","demand":"medium","response_complexity":"structured-response","source_pages":[13],"print_pages":[13],"provenance":{"source_paper_id":"J277-02-2024-June","source_question_id":"8(a)","source_file":"data/json/j277/yearpapers/J27702_Computational_thinking_algorithms_and_programming_June_2024 (3).json","bundle_id":"J277-02-2024-June::8(a)","context_id":"J277-02-2024-June::question-8","content_hash":"b43a3344c982dd9aebc709241191f204d7